@startuml
state Initial State
state Journey Details Displayed
state Driving Mode Active
state Options Selection
state Restaurant Selection
state Menu Viewing
state Order Placed
state Accident Handling
state Feedback Submission
state Journey Complete

[*] --> Initial State

Initial State -> Journey Details Displayed: User login and destination selection

Journey Details Displayed -> Driving Mode Active: Activate driving mode
Journey Details Displayed -> Options Selection: Choose other options

Options Selection -> Restaurant Selection: Select a place to eat

Restaurant Selection -> Menu Viewing: View menu

Menu Viewing -> Order Placed: Place order

Order Placed --> Journey Details Displayed

Journey Details Displayed -> Accident Handling: Accident occurs
Driving Mode Active -> Accident Handling: Accident occurs
Options Selection -> Accident Handling: Accident occurs
Restaurant Selection -> Accident Handling: Accident occurs
Menu Viewing -> Accident Handling: Accident occurs
Order Placed -> Accident Handling: Accident occurs

Accident Handling --> Journey Complete

Journey Details Displayed -> Feedback Submission: Provide feedback
Feedback Submission --> Journey Complete

Journey Complete --> [*]
@enduml
